  "query_preview": "(Monday through Thursday)...\nWith the weakening of offshore flow, a weak sea breeze will begin\nto spread some cooling into coastal areas with high temperatures\nnear the beaches cooling into the mid 80s with more elevated and\ninland coastal areas still warming into the mid to upper 90s. High\ntemperatures for the valleys will be mostly into the mid 90s to \n105. Low temperatures for the coast and valleys will gradually \ncool into the upper 60s to mid 70s for Wednesday and Thursday. \nExtreme HeatRisk will continue through Thursday from just inland \nof the beaches into the western valleys with Moderate to Major \nHeatRisk elsewhere for the coast and valleys.\n\nSome gradual cooling may develop beginning around Friday of next\nweek.",
